  "facts": {
    "solana": "Independent wallet-owned createWithSeed account, wallet staker and withdrawer; current instruction interface omits sysvar accounts; live minimum/rent and simulation; rewards remain inside stake balance.",
    "aptos": "Only DelegationPool exists; add_stake/unlock/withdraw. Minimum shares balance 1000000000 octas; add-stake fee reduces credited shares and unlock/withdraw can adjust amounts to avoid dust. Zero-signature simulation must emit exact reviewed amount; gas budget derives from simulation with 20%+100 units headroom.",
    "near": "Approved pool whitelist is required for new deposit_and_stake; existing position unstake/withdraw remains possible after delisting. get_account owns exact balances and can_withdraw; no inferred 4-epoch deadline. Fastnear discovers all known pool IDs, selected-network contracts prove wallet ownership and amount; full-access key required. Native storage reserve derives from protocol config.",
    "sui": "0x5 shared SuiSystemState initial_shared_version 1; request_add_stake takes Coin<SUI>/validator, creates wallet-owned StakedSui; request_withdraw_stake consumes entire StakedSui object and returns principal+rewards. Minimum 1000000000 MIST. Exact object owner/type/version/digest and dry-run before signing/first broadcast."
  },
